    "body": "# What does this PR do?\n\nFixes the paths and links in README.md / README_zh.md that no longer resolve:\n\n- `examples/requirements/` -> `requirements/`. The folder moved to the repo root in v0.9.5, so `ls examples/requirements` fails today. The sentence just above it already uses `requirements/metrics.txt`.\n- `src/api_demo.py` -> `src/api.py`. The changelog entry for the OpenAI-compatible API still points at the old filename.\n- `Qwen/Qwen2-Audio-7B-Instruct` -> full HF URL. Without the scheme, GitHub resolves it as a path inside the repo.\n\nDocs only, no code changes.\n\n## Before submitting\n\n- [x] Did you read the [contributor guideline](https://github.com/hiyouga/LLaMA-Factory/blob/main/.github/CONTRIBUTING.md)?\n- [ ] Did you write any new necessary tests?\n",
    "changed_files": 2,
